        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jakob Ragaz\n- Places: Switzerland\n- Topics: skiing, mountaineering, grand hotels\n\nFacts:\n- In Switzerland, skiing and mountaineering became two attractions that drew visitors.\n- Skiing and mountaineering in Switzerland led to the development of the \"grand hotels\" associated with Jakob Ragaz's work.\n- Jakob Ragaz worked on Swiss \"grand hotels\" that arose because of tourism tied to skiing and mountaineering.",
