        "original_id": "380931a2-1a0a-5d87-a255-245473c5911a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jakob Ragaz\n- Places: Switzerland, the Swiss Alps\n- Topics: Swiss tourism, grand hotels, skiing, mountaineering\n\nFacts:\n- During the second half of the nineteenth century, Switzerland experienced a tourism boom.\n- Jakob Ragaz is best known for his work on a series of grand hotels built in connection with the Swiss tourism boom.\n- Tourists are drawn to Switzerland's Alpine climate and landscapes.\n- Tourists visit Switzerland in particular for skiing and mountaineering.",
